Phase 3

The Facade simplifies the Main class by replacing many individual subsystem calls with one simple method, such as liftEmergencyLockdown(). This makes the All-Clear sequence easier to understand and reduces the chance of forgetting a step. If the NetworkTrafficController were replaced with another vendor's version, Main would not need to change as long as the Facade handles the differences. Only the Facade would need to be updated to work with the new subsystem.m

